WEBVTT

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.450
Come on, Pa!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.210
Wait!

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:21.430
Make way!

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.440
Move it!

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:38.910
Pa, some kids wearing red
<i>hitatare </i>just ran by.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.120
The <i>kaburo </i>boys.

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:42.330
"<i>Kaburo</i>?"

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:44.750
This is it.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.550
The <i>kaburo </i>arrest those
who speak ill of the Heike.

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:54.800
Let's go.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:58.470
Please, I beg you!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.220
Stop resisting!

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.470
You must come to the Rokuhara estate!

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.310
Blame your husband for his tongue!

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:07.190
He besmirched warriors! Called them vile!

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:11.610
Who makes it possible for you to
live here in safety and security?

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:12.780
Quite right!

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.660
Do not involve yourself.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:23.710
But... But Pa!

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:24.960
It's so terrible!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.920
What did you say?

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.180
I beg your forgiveness.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.520
Please.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.440
They are but the words of a child.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:48.900
This is your child?

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:55.490
In that case, <i>you </i>shall
accept the punishment.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:57.200
Pay for your crime.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.070
For sullying the Taira name.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.540
Pa!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.130
Pa!

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:32.610
♬ The Buddha's temple bells
toll the message ♬

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:37.900
♬ that all existence is impermanent. ♬

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:46.500
♬ The sal tree's blossoms
turn white to grieve him: ♬

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:54.590
♬ a reminder that all who
flourish must fall. ♬

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:27.120
THE HEIKE STORY

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:46.740
Episode 1

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.080
Drink!

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.650
My apologies for my lateness.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.530
Brother, the new year
and your convalescence

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.660
are truly cause for celebration.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.120
Tokitada, just where have you been?

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.540
Tokiko, dear. This is a celebration.
Let's just enjoy it.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:39.630
Whoops.

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:41.050
Goodness.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:42.170
Oh, my.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:52.810
Brother, I daresay that
monastic look truly suits you.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:55.480
Am I like the shining moon, perhaps?

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:58.560
More fitting to say the rising sun!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.440
The Taira clan has reached
new heights of glory!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.740
Lord Shigemori is Palace Minister
and Left Commander.

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:07.780
Lord Tomomori is third rank and a captain.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.410
Lord Koremori is fourth rank
and a lieutenant.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:15.710
Six senior nobles hail from our clan,
more than 30 privy gentlemen,

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:19.170
60 officials, including provincial
governors and guard officers.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:25.510
Of the 66 provinces, the Heike
governs more than 30 as territory.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:30.850
So great is our success, it is as if no
person outside the Heike is in government.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:35.680
No, those outside our clan are not people!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.070
You never do make merry.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.740
'Tis no fault.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.250
But,

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.870
it <i>is </i>boring.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.960
What is this?

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.840
The sea at Itsukushima.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.340
Amusing, is it not?

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:15.350
The torii gate and the building
are suspended in water...

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:16.770
I will build this.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:23.860
We prospered because
we controlled the sea.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:28.700
We built tremendous wealth as rulers of
Aki Province and accrued martial might.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.820
Then in the last war,

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.910
your military achievements brought victory
to Emperor Go-Shirakawa's side.

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:45.340
I will reside in Fukuhara.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:49.220
Fukuhara?! That is a day's
journey from the capital.

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:52.590
Moreover, there is nothing there.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.260
The sea is there.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:59.060
I will create a harbor
for large ships in Fukuhara.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:01.730
There we shall conduct
trade with Suo province.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:07.070
Not at Dazaifu as we have till now,
but at Fukuhara.

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:10.400
That shall produce wealth.
Wealth and might.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:16.120
With both of these at our disposal,
the Heike shall attain even greater glory.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:20.000
Thus we must offer thanks to the sea.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.540
Whereas I shall leave the capital,

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:28.760
the seat as head of the Taira
I leave to you, Shigemori.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.610
Despite his station as a warrior,

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:54.910
my father Tadamori was granted entrance
to the palace, becoming a privy gentleman.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:58.290
How dare a warrior set foot in the palace!

00:09:58.290 --> 00:09:59.790
He forgets his place!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.630
Carrying a sword into
the palace is not permitted!

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:12.800
He intimidated them with
a silver-lined bamboo sword.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.430
Amusing, is it not?

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:18.010
So I am boring then, am I?

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:20.350
Oh.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.300
Who are you?

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.060
How did you gain entrance here?

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.400
I came to tell you.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.530
You people's end is near.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.110
I speak the truth.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.160
I see it.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:21.160
Stay back!

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:23.790
Lord Shigemori!

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:24.830
What happened?

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:34.760
You... can see it?

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.680
I thought myself the only one...

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:41.300
What do you see?

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.720
What do <i>you </i>see?

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.390
I...

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.520
I see the dead.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:53.360
Wandering souls who know not where to go.

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:55.940
Is that...? Your father...

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.030
They killed him?

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.950
Heike warriors? Our warriors?

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.210
I am speechless.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.960
Pa...

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.300
Pa...

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:16.670
Pa did nothing wrong.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.380
Nothing at all!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.590
I am sorry.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:22.600
I am so sorry.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:25.390
Come on then. Kill me.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.560
Like--

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.600
Like they did Pa.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.650
Kill me like they killed Pa!

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:40.990
What's this?

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.320
Oh, dear. Oh, dear.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.120
Goodness me.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.080
Fleas!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:47.620
And lice too!

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.620
Do you truly intend to take this child in?

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.130
Do you?

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:56.170
Yes, well... Let's start with a
change of clothes and a room.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:59.090
If you wish, you are welcome
to spend some time here.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:03.930
Goodness me!

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:06.600
Oh, my!

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.930
Goodness!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.480
Oh, my...

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.940
Goodness...

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:17.900
A girl, you say...

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.070
Yes.

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:21.110
Then could she be a court lady?

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:24.570
Well, she said,
"I refuse to dress like a girl."

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:29.870
And, "Pa always made me
dress like a boy, so I am a boy."

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:38.760
I see. Her father must have been doing
that out of concern for her safety.

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:43.640
Oh, my...

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:45.680
Goodness...

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.180
Where does it all go?

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:54.810
Starting tomorrow, educate her
on manners and etiquette.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:55.810
Of course.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.830
What is your name?

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.000
Biwa.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.000
Biwa, is it?

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:24.300
Pa never used my name. Thus I know it not.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.640
I chose that name.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:27.720
I see.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.060
A fine name it is.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.730
Because I love this instrument.
Almost...

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.780
Almost as much as I love Pa...

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:48.120
Biwa, would you stay here after all?

00:14:57.170 --> 00:15:02.340
For my sake as well as yours.
I would like you to stay.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:06.010
I want you to tell me
what your eye shows you.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:10.100
Then perhaps I might
avert the fall of my clan.

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.180
No. I won't do that.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:19.110
Pa told me not to look.
That I mustn't look at the future.

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:28.240
Father, we are all here.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:36.620
Biwa, meet Koremori, Sukemori,
Kiyotsune, and Arimori.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:40.500
Biwa here will be staying with us.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.090
Who is this kid?

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:46.840
Biwa will live here at the estate
and be your playmate.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.090
A warrior's kid?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:48.970
No.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:51.140
A biwa musician's!

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:54.060
Ah, someone of low birth.

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:57.640
I can't stand you people after all!

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:59.230
Come, now, Biwa.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:05.240
Biwa, please accept my gratitude
for your friendship.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:11.200
You too, Sukemori.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:25.610
Wh-What is it?

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.070
I still refuse.

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:30.400
To look at the future.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:37.580
I was just thinking how beautiful
the color of your eye is.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:41.000
I never felt that way about my own eye.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:49.260
It's not beautiful. Pa feared my eye.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:54.340
I too am frightened by my eye.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:59.470
It shows me naught but
departed souls in the dark.

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:09.070
Shigemori.

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:19.660
Would you like me to take you along?

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.500
No way.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:22.870
It'll be better without you.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.380
Sukemori.

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:29.000
Lady Tokuko!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.840
She is Father's younger sister.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:32.300
To what do we owe this pleasure?

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:36.720
Father is coming from Fukuhara.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:38.010
Grandfather?

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:41.140
Then I shall hunt down
something amazing for him!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.100
Take care not to be chased around
by something amazing instead.

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:48.150
I must depart now.

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:49.320
Let's go.

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:54.320
You're really a girl, right?

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:57.200
I can tell.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.700
So why are you dressed like a boy?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.790
I, uh...

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:08.130
It might be better that way.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.500
A woman's life is...

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:21.890
What's wrong?

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:33.150
You failed to alight before
His Highness the regent?

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:39.200
I was hurrying back from my hunt...

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.370
Onward! Onward!

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.080
They yelled that that was insolent...

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:44.540
What nerve!

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.790
To treat a child this way is excessive.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:51.340
However, it was you who
broke etiquette, Sukemori.

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:55.800
Lord Motofusa is
Emperor Takakura's regent!

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:02.220
To remedy this, I shall offer
His Highness my apologies as well.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.640
Wait.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.980
I have an idea.

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:10.060
This is a job for Rokuhara's warriors.

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:13.150
Rokuhara's warriors,

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:16.530
300 riders in full
armor, lay in wait.

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:19.700
They hemmed his Highness in

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:25.410
and all at once let loose
a great battle cry.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:32.500
His retinue was chased to, cornered fro,

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:35.130
pulled from their steeds...

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.090
...and stripped of their topknots.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:45.520
This was the beginning
of the Heike's villainy.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:54.520
Father, the fault lay with us!
By any measure you have gone too far!

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.900
We cannot allow the Heike
to be taken lightly.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.650
Besides,

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.240
it's amusing, is it not?

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:07.040
He does whatever he pleases!

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:12.670
He left worldly life and left the capital.
I thought I would finally be rid of him!

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:18.840
How can the Court possibly save face now?

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.840
After they made such a...

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.890
...fool of the Emperor's regent!
